	le seating when you order tickets. Bags up to 12" x 6" x 12" are allowed i
	n the venue. All bags will be searched prior to entry. For more FAQs pleas
	e visit www.houston.houseofblues.com/faq\nBOX OFFICE: 5:00 PM DOORS: 6:00 
